*** Settings ***
Documentation       Generic accessibility checks - these keywords are used in tests.
Resource            ${EXECDIR}/resources/interactions/accessibility_interactions.resource


*** Keywords ***
Page Should Have No Serious Violations
    [Documentation]    Checks that there are no serious or critical violations.
    ...    Which impacts count is set in abilities/browser_ability.resource (A11Y_BLOCKING_IMPACTS).
    [Arguments]    ${violations}
    VAR    @{blocking}    @{EMPTY}
    FOR    ${violation}    IN    @{violations}
        IF    $violation['impact'] in $A11Y_BLOCKING_IMPACTS
            VAR    ${text}    ${violation['impact']}: ${violation['help']} (${violation['id']}, ${violation['count']}x)
            VAR    @{blocking}    @{blocking}    ${text}
        END
    END
    Should Be Empty    ${blocking}    Accessibility violated: ${blocking}
